---
import CaseStudy from '../../layouts/CaseStudy.astro';
---

<CaseStudy
  caseTitle="Rap In Cena — Mobifans"
  caseDesc="Enxoval visual completo para a participação da Mobifans no Rap in Cena: materiais físicos, mockups 3D e identidade de evento."
  casePath="/projetos/mobi_ric.html"
  ogImage="/projetos/mobi_ric/Banner_MobiNoRIC_21_9.webp"
  heroImageHref="/projetos/mobi_ric/Banner_MobiNoRIC_21_9.webp"
>

  <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
  <div class="case-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container case-breadcrumb__inner">
      <a class="case-breadcrumb__link" href="../projetos.html" data-en="← Projects">← Projetos</a>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__sep">·</span>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__current" data-en="Case">Case</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CASE HEADER -->
  <section class="case-header" aria-labelledby="case-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="case-header__eyebrow" data-en="Case · Graphic Design · Client">
        Case · Design Gráfico · Mobifans
      </p>
      <h1 class="case-header__title" id="case-title">
        Rap in<br />Cena.
      </h1>
      <div class="case-header__meta">
        <span class="case-header__date" data-en="2025">2025</span>
        <div class="case-header__tags">
          <span class="tech-tag">Photoshop</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Illustrator</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Blender</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="Graphic Design">Design Gráfico</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="3D Mockup">Mockup 3D</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HERO DO CASE -->
  <div class="case-hero" role="img" aria-label="Banner do projeto Rap in Cena — Mobifans">
    <img class="case-hero__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/Banner_MobiNoRIC_21_9.webp"
         alt="Rap in Cena — materiais gráficos para evento da Mobifans" width="2100" height="900" loading="eager" />
  </div>

  <!-- 01 — CONTEXTO / PROBLEMA -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="ctx-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="ctx-title" data-en="01 — Context / Problem">01 — Contexto / Problema</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="client · event · deliverables">cliente · evento · entregas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-2" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="<strong style='color: var(--color-ink);'>Mobifans</strong> took part in the <strong style='color: var(--color-ink);'>Rap in Cena</strong> event with its own tent, offering on-site phone case and back-film customization. All graphic material had to be created from scratch — large-format physical pieces and 3D mockups for product visualization.">
            A <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">Mobifans</strong> participou do evento <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">Rap in Cena</strong> com uma tenda própria, oferecendo personalização de capinhas e películas no local. Todo o material gráfico precisava ser criado do zero — peças físicas de grande formato e mockups 3D para visualização dos produtos.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="The challenge was to produce a full kit of coherent materials — from communication in the tent's physical space to the exclusive artwork for the products delivered at the event — on a tight deadline and with a visual language aligned with the rap universe.">
            O desafio era produzir um kit completo de materiais coerentes entre si — da comunicação no espaço físico da tenda até as artes exclusivas dos produtos que seriam entregues no evento — com prazo curto e linguagem visual alinhada ao universo do rap.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5);">
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Context">Contexto</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Mobifans — personalized phone case kiosks. Presence at a rap event with its own tent and exclusive products for the show's audience.">
              Mobifans — quiosques de capinhas personalizadas. Presença em evento de rap com tenda própria e produtos exclusivos para o público do show.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);" >
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Core problem">Problema central</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Create a full graphic kit for an event — large-format physical pieces + exclusive products + digital material — in a cohesive way with its own identity.">
              Criar um kit gráfico completo para um evento — peças físicas de grande formato + produtos exclusivos + material digital — de forma coesa e com identidade própria.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-yellow); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="Opportunity">Oportunidade</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="Use the event as a brand showcase: exclusive products and realistic 3D mockups that generated desire even before the purchase.">
              Usar o evento como vitrine de marca: produtos exclusivos e mockups 3D realistas que gerassem desejo antes mesmo da compra.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 — MEU PAPEL -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="papel-title" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="papel-title" data-en="02 — My Role">02 — Meu Papel</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="art direction · graphic design · 3D">direção de arte · design gráfico · 3D</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-3" data-reveal>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Art Direction">Direção de Arte</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Definition of the kit's visual language — palette, typography, references from the rap universe — ensuring cohesion across all physical and digital pieces.">
            Definição da linguagem visual do kit — paleta, tipografia, referências do universo rap — garantindo coesão entre todas as peças físicas e digitais.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Graphic Design">Design Gráfico</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Creation of the 4 A3 posters, 2m × 0.5m banner, 3m × 1m backdrop, 3 back-film artworks and 3 custom cover artworks — exclusive to the event.">
            Criação dos 4 lambes A3, banner 2m × 0,5m, backdrop 3m × 1m, 3 artes de película traseira e 3 artes de capa personalizada — exclusivas para o evento.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="3D & Mockup">3D & Mockup</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Modeling and rendering of the tent in 3D for prior space visualization, plus 3D mockups of the films and covers for Instagram communication.">
            Modelagem e renderização da tenda em 3D para visualização prévia do espaço, mais mockups 3D das películas e capas para comunicação no Instagram.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 — PROCESSO & SOLUÇÃO -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="processo-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="processo-title" data-en="03 — Process & Solution">03 — Processo & Solução</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="concept · production · mockups">conceito · produção · mockups</span>
      </div>

      <div class="case-img-pair" data-reveal>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/processo_01.webp" alt="Referências e conceito visual do evento" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 01 · concept & references">Passo 01 · Conceito e Referências</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/processo_02.webp" alt="Artes finalizadas — lambes e banner" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 02 · finished artworks">Passo 02 · Artes Finalizadas</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="With the event briefing in hand, the first step was to define a visual language that spoke to the rap universe without losing Mobifans's identity. The palette and typography were chosen to work both on the posters plastered around the space and on the smaller pieces for the personalized products.">
        Com o briefing do evento em mãos, o primeiro passo foi definir uma linguagem visual que conversasse com o universo do rap sem perder a identidade da <strong>Mobifans</strong>. A paleta e tipografia foram escolhidas para funcionar tanto nos lambes colados no espaço quanto nas peças menores dos produtos personalizados.
      </p>
      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="The <strong>3D mockups</strong> were the differentiator: the tent was modeled in Blender for prior approval of the space layout, and the films and covers were rendered in real context for Instagram communication — generating desire even before arriving at the event.">
        Os <strong>mockups 3D</strong> foram o diferencial: a tenda foi modelada no Blender para aprovação prévia do layout do espaço, e as películas e capas foram renderizadas em contexto real para comunicação no Instagram — gerando desejo antes mesmo da chegada ao evento.
      </p>

      <div class="case-code" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" role="region" aria-label="Especificações dos materiais gráficos produzidos" data-en="<span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>// Rap in Cena — specs of produced pieces</span>

<span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;>PHYSICAL</span>
  Posters (A3)       <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>297 × 420 mm</span>   <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>× 4 artworks</span>
  Main banner        <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>2000 × 500 mm</span>  <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>× 1 piece</span>
  Backdrop           <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>3000 × 1000 mm</span> <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>× 1 piece (based on the kiosks)</span>
  Back film          <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>exclusive artwork</span>  <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>× 3 designs + 3D mockup</span>
  Custom cover       <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>exclusive artwork</span>  <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>× 3 designs + 3D mockup</span>

<span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;>DIGITAL</span>
  3D tent            <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>Blender render</span>  <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>space visualization</span>
  Instagram          <span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;>2 videos</span>        <span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;>assets provided by event production</span>"><span class="tok-comment">// Rap in Cena — especificações das peças produzidas</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">FÍSICOS</span>
  Lambes (A3)        <span class="tok-string">297 × 420 mm</span>   <span class="tok-comment">× 4 artes</span>
  Banner principal   <span class="tok-string">2000 × 500 mm</span>  <span class="tok-comment">× 1 peça</span>
  Backdrop           <span class="tok-string">3000 × 1000 mm</span> <span class="tok-comment">× 1 peça (baseado nos quiosques)</span>
  Película traseira  <span class="tok-string">arte exclusiva</span>  <span class="tok-comment">× 3 designs + mockup 3D</span>
  Capa personalizada <span class="tok-string">arte exclusiva</span>  <span class="tok-comment">× 3 designs + mockup 3D</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">DIGITAL</span>
  Tenda 3D           <span class="tok-string">Blender render</span>  <span class="tok-comment">visualização do espaço</span>
  Instagram          <span class="tok-string">2 vídeos</span>        <span class="tok-comment">assets cedidos pela produção do evento</span></div>

      <div class="case-img-trio" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/processo_03.webp" alt="Lambe A3 finalizado" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="LAMBE · A3 FORMAT">LAMBE · FORMATO A3</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/processo_04.webp" alt="Mockup 3D de película traseira" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="3D MOCKUP · BACK FILM">MOCKUP 3D · PELÍCULA</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img class="case-img-trio__img" src="/projetos/mobi_ric/processo_05.webp" alt="Mockup 3D da tenda do evento" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="3D TENT · EVENT SPACE">TENDA 3D · ESPAÇO DO EVENTO</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3D — TENDA MOBIFANS -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="tenda3d-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="tenda3d-title" data-en="3D — Event Tent">3D — Tenda do Evento</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="blender · sketchfab · interactive">blender · sketchfab · interativo</span>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="border: var(--border-thick); box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl); overflow: hidden; position: relative; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: var(--color-surface);">
        <iframe
          title="Tenda Mobifans — Rap In Cena 2025"
          frameborder="0"
          allowfullscreen
          mozallowfullscreen="true"
          webkitallowfullscreen="true"
          allow="autoplay; fullscreen; xr-spatial-tracking"
          xr-spatial-tracking
          execution-while-out-of-viewport
          execution-while-not-rendered
          web-share
          src="https://sketchfab.com/models/577599c5fef446b0b47d846143300395/embed?autostart=1&annotations_visible=1&preload=1&annotation_cycle=5&transparent=1"
          style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none;"
          loading="lazy">
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 — RESULTADO -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="resultado-title" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="resultado-title" data-en="04 — Result">04 — Resultado</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="event · delivered · applied">evento · entregue · aplicado</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-resultado" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <div class="metric-cards">
            <div class="metric-card metric-card--accent">
              <p class="metric-card__number">12+</p>
              <p class="metric-card__label" data-en="Pieces delivered">Peças entregues</p>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-card metric-card--plain">
              <p class="metric-card__number">8</p>
              <p class="metric-card__label" data-en="Different formats">Formatos diferentes</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="case-resultado__impact" data-en="<strong>Full kit delivered for the event.</strong> All physical pieces produced and applied at the tent: posters, banner and backdrop. The personalized films and covers were applied for free to tent visitors, generating direct engagement with the product.">
            <strong>Kit completo entregue para o evento.</strong> Todas as peças físicas produzidas e aplicadas na tenda: lambes, banner e backdrop. As películas e capas personalizadas foram aplicadas gratuitamente para os visitantes da tenda, gerando engajamento direto com o produto.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <video class="case-resultado__screenshot" width="800" height="600" autoplay loop muted playsinline aria-label="Materiais do Rap in Cena aplicados no evento">
            <source src="/projetos/mobi_ric/Processo_06.webm" type="video/webm">
            <p>Seu navegador não suporta a tag de vídeo.</p>
          </video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRÓXIMO CASE -->
  <section class="case-next" aria-label="Próximo case">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="mobi_estampas.html" class="case-next__card" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="case-next__label" data-en="Next case →">Próximo case →</p>
          <p class="case-next__title" data-en="MobiStudio<br />Stamps.">Estampas<br />MobiStudio.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="case-next__thumb" src="/projetos/mobi_estampas/Banner_mobiestampas_21_9.webp" alt="Thumbnail Estampas MobiStudio" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="case-next__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</CaseStudy>
